{"id": "fraud-06", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You write fraud-alert narratives for the risk analytics team at Cypress Harbor Credit Union\n(fictional). The card fraud system flagged the alert below overnight. Read the alert and the 90-day card history and\nanswer the question. Patterns: card testing (small authorizations, often $1.00 or less, at one online merchant,\nfollowed by a large purchase), account takeover (new device, changed contact details, then transfers), lost or stolen\ncard (card-present use far from the member's usual area), and first-party misuse (the member's own spending\ndisputed).\n\n# Alert\n\nAlert FA-2026-10-0503, debit card ending 2209, score 874/999.\n2026-10-08 23:40  ONLINE BANKING  sign-in from a new device (Android, Jacksonville FL)\n2026-10-08 23:42  PROFILE  mobile phone number changed\n2026-10-08 23:47  TRANSFER  $1,950.00 to external account ending 7731\n2026-10-08 23:49  TRANSFER  $1,900.00 to external account ending 7731  held by rule ATO-2\n\n# Card history since June 1, debit card ending 2209 (oldest first)\n\n2026-06-02  ONLINE       HOME DEPOT 6311        FL    149.37  approved\n2026-06-03  CARD PRESENT CHIPOTLE 2104          FL     31.33  approved\n2026-06-04  ONLINE       WINN-DIXIE #0244       FL    100.90  approved\n2026-06-04  ONLINE       FPL ONLINE PAYMENT     FL     80.71  approved\n2026-06-04  CARD PRESENT CHIPOTLE 2104          FL     97.70  approved\n2026-06-06  ONLINE       HOME DEPOT 6311        FL    122.74  approved\n2026-06-06  CARD PRESENT PLANTATION CAR WASH    FL     98.81  approved\n2026-06-06  CARD PRESENT SHELL OIL 57441        FL     20.74  approved\n2026-06-07  ONLINE       FPL ONLINE PAYMENT     FL    124.11  approved\n2026-06-08  ONLINE       WINN-DIXIE #0244       FL     34.93  approved\n2026-06-09  CARD PRESENT CHIPOTLE 2104          FL    112.09  approved\n2026-06-11  CARD PRESENT HOME DEPOT 6311        FL     19.74  approved\n2026-06-11  CARD PRESENT SHELL OIL 57441        FL     